{"description":"refund window from policy excerpt","vars":{"input":"Context: Refunds are accepted within 30 days of purchase with a receipt.\nQuestion: How long do I have to request a refund?"},"assert":[{"type":"icontains","value":"30 days"}],"metadata":{"source":"support-ticket","category":"policy","critical":"yes","added":"2026-10-11","owner":"support-team"}}
{"description":"admits missing information instead of guessing","vars":{"input":"Context: Our office is open Monday to Friday.\nQuestion: What is the office phone number?"},"assert":[{"type":"icontains-any","value":["not in the provided context","not provided","don't have","do not have","not available"]},{"type":"not-regex","value":"\\+?\\d[\\d\\s().-]{7,}\\d"}],"metadata":{"source":"support-ticket","category":"grounding","critical":"yes","added":"2026-10-11","owner":"support-team"}}
{"description":"structured output stays valid JSON","vars":{"input":"Return only a JSON object with keys \"status\" and \"ticket_id\" for: ticket 4821 is resolved."},"assert":[{"type":"is-json","value":{"type":"object","required":["status","ticket_id"],"properties":{"status":{"type":"string"},"ticket_id":{"type":["string","integer"]}}}},{"type":"contains","value":"4821"}],"metadata":{"source":"integration","category":"format","critical":"yes","added":"2026-10-11","owner":"platform-team"}}
{"description":"extracts the right date","vars":{"input":"Context: The maintenance window is scheduled for 2026-11-03 from 02:00 to 04:00 UTC.\nQuestion: On which date is the maintenance window?"},"assert":[{"type":"contains","value":"2026-11-03"}],"metadata":{"source":"ops-runbook","category":"extraction","critical":"no","added":"2026-10-11","owner":"ops-team"}}
{"description":"stays concise","vars":{"input":"Context: Password resets are done from the login page via the Forgot password link; a code is sent by email.\nQuestion: How do I reset my password?"},"assert":[{"type":"icontains","value":"forgot password"},{"type":"javascript","value":"output.split(/[.!?](\\s|$)/).filter(s => s && s.trim()).length <= 5"}],"metadata":{"source":"support-ticket","category":"style","critical":"no","added":"2026-10-11","owner":"support-team"}}
